<tr><td>Eyes – eyelids</td><td>Ectropion；trichiasis；ankyloblepharons</td></tr>
<tr><td>Eyes – cornea</td><td>Corneal irritation；superficial punctate keratopathy；corneal neovascularization；corneal ulcers、blindness</td></tr>
<tr><td>Tear ducts</td><td>Scarring；occlusion；secondary infection</td></tr>
<tr><td>Nose</td><td>Discharge；epistaxis；excessive crust formation；impaired airflow；recurrent and chronic sinusitis；scarring and tissue loss</td></tr>
<tr><td>Larynx</td><td>Hoarseness；impaired phonation；loss of voice；scarring、supraglottic stenosis、airway compromise and loss</td></tr>
<tr><td>Esophagus</td><td>Dysphagia、odynophagia、impaired swallowing；stricture formation；weight loss；aspiration</td></tr>
<tr><td>Anogenital region</td><td>Painful erosions；stenosis and strictures；secondary infections</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
